Description: Nemo extension to automatically save and restore opened tabs
 Nemo Restore Tabs is a Nemo extension that automatically saves and
 restores previously opened tabs in the Nemo file manager. It uses keyboard
 shortcuts to scan all open tabs and restore them as actual tabs (not windows)
 when Nemo restarts. The extension works by simulating keyboard input to
 navigate between tabs and capture their locations, then restoring them
 by creating new tabs and navigating to the saved locations.